---
// Near-twin features share credit. Python run (exact Shapley, 8-stock background, stock D):
// model "both" (0.35 on 12m momentum, 0.25 on 6m momentum): 12m +0.549, 6m +0.178 (score 1.540)
// model "one"  (0.60 on 12m momentum, 0 on 6m momentum):    12m +0.908, 6m 0.000 (score 1.625)
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 344;
const X0 = 250, S = 360;
---
<figure class="atp09-tw">
  <div class="atp09-tw-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two models give stock D almost the same score, 1.540 and 1.625. The first spreads momentum credit over two correlated features, 0.549 on 12-month and 0.178 on 6-month momentum. The second uses only 12-month momentum and gives it 0.908.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Two models, almost the same score, different credit</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai mô hình, điểm gần như nhau, phần công khác nhau</tspan>
      </text>

      <g>
        <rect x="20" y="50" width="860" height="108" rx="8" class="card" />
        <DiagramIcon name="model" x={46} y={80} size={24} />
        <text x="74" y="86" class="t">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Model 1 uses both momentum features. Score for D: 1.540</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Mô hình 1 dùng cả hai feature momentum. Điểm của D: 1,540</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="40" y="118" class="lab">
          <tspan data-lang-en>12-month</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>12 tháng</tspan>
        </text>
        <rect x={X0} y="104" width={0.549 * S} height="18" class="bar" />
        <text x={X0 + 0.549 * S + 8} y="118" class="val">
          <tspan data-lang-en>+0.549</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>+0,549</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="40" y="144" class="lab">
          <tspan data-lang-en>6-month</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>6 tháng</tspan>
        </text>
        <rect x={X0} y="130" width={0.178 * S} height="18" class="bar" />
        <text x={X0 + 0.178 * S + 8} y="144" class="val">
          <tspan data-lang-en>+0.178</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>+0,178</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="20" y="170" width="860" height="108" rx="8" class="card" />
        <DiagramIcon name="model" x={46} y={200} size={24} />
        <text x="74" y="206" class="t">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Model 2 drops the 6-month feature. Score for D: 1.625</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Mô hình 2 bỏ feature 6 tháng. Điểm của D: 1,625</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="40" y="238" class="lab">
          <tspan data-lang-en>12-month</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>12 tháng</tspan>
        </text>
        <rect x={X0} y="224" width={0.908 * S} height="18" class="bar is-key" />
        <text x={X0 + 0.908 * S + 8} y="238" class="val">
          <tspan data-lang-en>+0.908</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>+0,908</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x="40" y="264" class="lab">
          <tspan data-lang-en>6-month</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>6 tháng</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x={X0 + 8} y="264" class="val">
          <tspan data-lang-en>0.000</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>0,000</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>

      <text x="20" y="306" class="n">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Read the 12-month number alone and it falls from 0.908 to 0.549, though both models lean on momentum.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc riêng số của 12 tháng thì nó tụt từ 0,908 xuống 0,549, dù cả hai mô hình đều dựa vào momentum.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="326" class="n">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Add the twins (0.549 + 0.178 = 0.727) before you judge.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hãy cộng hai feature song sinh (0,549 + 0,178 = 0,727) rồi mới kết luận.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp09-tw { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp09-tw-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp09-tw svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp09-tw text { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 14px; }
  .atp09-tw .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tw .t { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tw .lab { fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tw .val { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tw .n { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-tw .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp09-tw .bar { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp09-tw .bar.is-key { fill: var(--act-2); }
</style>
